# Validity of joint states: inside joint limits, no self-collision, clear of the world.
# Each trajectory point is one state. With max_step > 0 and several points, the motion between
# consecutive points is also sampled (largest joint step max_step rad); a sampled check, so gaps
# thinner than max_step can be missed.
trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory states
float64 max_step
---
# The check ran (false for bad input or an unavailable planner; see message).
bool success
# Every given state valid and, when max_step > 0, every sampled state in between.
bool collision_free
# One entry per given state.
bool[] state_valid
string message
